{
  "info": {
    "name": "Settlix Payout API",
    "description": "Complete Payout API collection for Settlix Payment Platform.\n\n## Auth\n- All endpoints require `X-API-KEY` header with merchant's payout API key\n- POST/PUT/PATCH also require `X-Idempotency-Key` header (UUID v4)\n\n## Getting Your Payout API Key\n1. Login to Payment API: POST /api/v1/portal/auth/login\n2. Get credentials: GET /api/v1/portal/merchant/credentials\n3. Use the payout API key from the response\n\n## Test Scenarios (Account Number Suffixes)\n- Ending 0001: SUCCESS\n- Ending 0002: RETRY then SUCCESS\n- Ending 0003: FAILED\n- Ending 0004: PENDING\n- Ending 0005: ON_HOLD\n- Amount >= 100,000: IN_REVIEW\n\n## Valid Bank Codes\nHBL, UBL, MCB, ABL, JSBL, BAHL, MEEZAN, ASKARI, BANKALHABIB, SONERI, FBL, BOP, NBP, SBP\n\n## Valid Wallet Codes\nEASYPAISA, JAZZCASH, SADAPAY, NAYAPAY",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://sbx-api.settlix.net",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "payoutApiKey",
      "value": "settlix_sk_c56afd1c5e6ce3831a1b13a12b5b00e1d6787423bd41427667076c86bfb65b31",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "payoutId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "health"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payouts",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Payout (Bank - Success)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('payoutId', jsonData.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-API-KEY",
                "value": "{{payoutApiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchantReference\": \"PAYOUT-001\",\n  \"amount\": 5000,\n  \"currency\": \"PKR\",\n  \"destType\": \"BANK\",\n  \"bankCode\": \"HBL\",\n  \"accountNumber\": \"1234567890001\",\n  \"accountTitle\": \"Test User Success\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "payouts"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
